* STARTZ3P - SUPPLIED STARTUP ALIAS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* STARTZ3P - SUPPLIED STARTUP ALIAS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    A0:STARTZ3P

Private compiled startup sequence. The captured alias sets PATH to A0,
restores console input through I13:GET CONSOLE, selects A0 and runs
A0:BYE.

It is invoked during startup; do not rerun it inside an active caller
session. Edit only a backed-up copy while stopped. The host Start-
RCPM.command launcher remains the normal way to start the installation.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
